<title>URUGUAY: SOCCER-URUGUAY AND COLOMBIA DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-URUGUAY AND COLOMBIA DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>MONTEVIDEO 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uruguay and Colombia drew 1-1 (halftime 1-0) in a South American World Cup qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Uruguay - Dario Silva 7</p>
<p>Colombia - Hamilton Ricard 47</p>
<p>Attendance 50,000</p>
